WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Friday night, every table is full.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.040
And the phone, it will not stop ringing.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.520
Every missed call is a table you did not book

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.280
or a regular who gave up.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.720
I cannot cook the pasta and answer the phone.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:15.960
Nobody can.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:19.160
So my AI answers every call and books every table.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.000
In English.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.060
Whatever your guests speak.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.080
Now, we cook.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.340
He books.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:28.600
Buonissimo.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.440
Mancha.
